        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Victor Salva, Emilio Fernández, Ray Wise\n- Films and TV: Jeepers Creepers 2, Swamp Thing, RoboCop, Twin Peaks, 24, Reaper\n- Companies: American Zoetrope, Capitol Films, Myriad Pictures, United Artists, Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer\n- Roles: film director, screenwriter, actor\n\nFacts:\n- Emilio Fernández was born as Emilio Fernández Romo on March 26, 1904, and he was a Mexican film director, actor, and screenwriter.\n- Victor Ronald Salva was born on March 29, 1958, and he is an American film director and screenwriter.\n- Emilio Fernández died on August 6, 1986.\n- Ray Wise played Alec Holland in Swamp Thing in 1982.\n- Ray Wise played Leon C. Nash in RoboCop in 1987.\n- Ray Wise played Leland Palmer in Twin Peaks from 1990 to 1991.\n- Jeepers Creepers 2 is a 2003 American horror film written and directed by Victor Salva.\n- Jeepers Creepers 2 was produced by American Zoetrope, Capitol Films, and Myriad Pictures, and it was distributed by United Artists, a Metro-Goldwyn-Mayer division.\n- Ray Wise played Jack Taggart Sr. in Jeepers Creepers 2 in 2003.\n- Ray Wise played Vice President Hal Gardner in 24 in 2006.\n- Ray Wise played The Devil in Reaper from 2007 to 2009.",
